                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Your rights, your sister\u2019s rights, your daughter\u2019s rights, or your wife\u2019s rights and health should not depend on where in the country you live. \n\nAll of this is preventable. It\u2019s time to get the government out of the doctor\u2019s office.",
