                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "To call this bad is an understatement. This could be deadly for millions of children. \n \nThere's a reason we don't hear about kids getting Hepatitis anymore: we have vaccines that prevent them from getting it. RFK now wants to undo that.\n \nThe U.S. needs to take health recommendations from doctors and scientists, not conspiracy theorists.",
