                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "350K New Jersey residents are about to lose health care thanks to the Big Ugly Bill. But nearly 80% of them shouldn't: new requirements and unnecessary red tape from the bill will kick otherwise eligible people off their care.\n\nCommissioner Sarah Adelman of NJ's Human Services spoke with me about how these cuts are going to force the state to make impossible decisions. Watch \ud83d\udcf9 \u27a1\ufe0f",
