                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans are about to let tax credits for the Affordable Care Act expire, which will cause health care costs to nearly double for thousands of Americans.\n\nWhat you need to know, and how I\u2019m fighting to keep costs down: https://t.co/vJO1YFO3jt",
