                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Costs are high enough as it is. And now, health care costs are going to nearly double in 2026 when tax credits under the Affordable Care Act expire.\n \nI voted NO on Republicans\u2019 funding bill today: they refused to act to save people\u2019s health care. I will not sit by as they give tax cuts to the rich and make costs even greater for everyone else.",
