                "text": "Trump and Secretary Brainworm have yet again undermined trust in medicine by falsely claiming Tylenol causes autism. If only it were that easy to find the cause of autism in our medicine cabinets. \n \nThis unproven claim will cause unnecessary widespread confusion that will hurt families. If you are uncertain about what medicine to take: call your doctor.",
