                "text": "Even Rep. Marjorie Taylor Greene agrees that we can\u2019t allow Republicans to raise health care costs for millions of Americans.\n\nIf we don\u2019t act, insurance premiums will go up at least $4,000 for families and $1,200 for individuals in NJ on the ACA. It\u2019s time to get back to work for the American people.",
